docs {
Cabut mute IP/device + netralkan skor abuse (event admin_lift berbobot
-skor30d) - hanya admin & root. Kunci dikirim di body karena IPv6 berisi ":".
Idempoten: removed=false bila memang tidak sedang di-mute.
Tercatat di audit log (action lift_anon_mute, entity_type anon_subject).

200 sukses:

    {
      "success": true,
      "data": {
        "subject_kind": "ip",
        "subject_key": "203.0.113.9",
        "removed": true,
        "previous_score_30d": 4
      }
    }

400 VALIDATION_ERROR: subject_kind bukan ip/device atau subject_key kosong.
}

meta {
  name: Lift Anon Mute
  seq: 4
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/abuse/anon-mutes/lift
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{access_token}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "subject_kind": "ip",
    "subject_key": "203.0.113.9"
  }
}

tests {
  test("200 + removed boolean", () => {
    expect(res.status).to.equal(200);
    expect(res.body.success).to.equal(true);
    expect(res.body.data.removed).to.be.a("boolean");
  });
}
